1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,163
AI agents are starting to spend company money:

2
00:00:04,213 --> 00:00:06,631
software, suppliers, refunds.

3
00:00:06,681 --> 00:00:09,693
So every CFO asks the same question:

4
00:00:09,743 --> 00:00:11,650
who is holding the pen?

5
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,949
Give an agent a card number and hope, or approve every

6
00:00:16,999 --> 00:00:18,168
cent yourself.

7
00:00:18,218 --> 00:00:21,213
One is a risk no auditor signs off.

8
00:00:21,263 --> 00:00:23,650
The other saves you nothing.

9
00:00:24,300 --> 00:00:29,649
Purser gives every AI agent its own company card and its

10
00:00:29,699 --> 00:00:34,662
own on-chain mandate, with limits the CFO sets once.

11
00:00:34,712 --> 00:00:37,650
Anything new waits for Face ID.

12
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:38,687
Watch.

13
00:00:38,737 --> 00:00:41,234
The operations agent buys software:

14
00:00:41,284 --> 00:00:42,836
approved by Airwallex.

15
00:00:42,886 --> 00:00:47,203
Then the Pro plan, forty-five euros, on a thirty euro limit:

16
00:00:47,253 --> 00:00:49,314
declined, by the bank itself.

17
00:00:49,364 --> 00:00:51,061
The agent asks for more.

18
00:00:51,111 --> 00:00:55,210
The CFO checks the exact terms and approves with Face ID.

19
00:00:55,260 --> 00:00:59,650
The limit moves to fifty, and the same purchase goes through.

20
00:01:00,300 --> 00:01:02,136
A euro invoice arrives:

21
00:01:02,186 --> 00:01:04,350
eighteen hundred and fifty.

22
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:09,761
The finance agent checks balances and reserve floors, takes a live

23
00:01:09,811 --> 00:01:14,845
quote and converts only the missing three hundred and seventy.

24
00:01:14,895 --> 00:01:19,026
One Face ID covers the rate, the payee and the fee.

25
00:01:19,076 --> 00:01:21,240
Airwallex pays it by SWIFT:

26
00:01:21,290 --> 00:01:21,650
paid.

27
00:01:22,300 --> 00:01:26,236
On Metal, agents pay per request, cents at a time, under

28
00:01:26,286 --> 00:01:28,230
mandates that live on chain.

29
00:01:28,280 --> 00:01:32,999
When the supplier doubles its price, the payment hits the mandate's

30
00:01:33,049 --> 00:01:34,138
cap and bounces:

31
00:01:34,188 --> 00:01:37,484
nothing moves, and the customer is not charged.

32
00:01:37,534 --> 00:01:42,040
Purser prices two options, Opus reviews them, the CFO signs one,

33
00:01:42,090 --> 00:01:44,816
and the mandates are replaced on chain.

34
00:01:44,866 --> 00:01:49,799
Mandates, x402, signed orders, payouts, clearing and a receive policy:

35
00:01:49,849 --> 00:01:51,650
all live on Metal testnet.

36
00:01:52,300 --> 00:01:53,927
Then a customer says:

37
00:01:53,977 --> 00:01:57,759
our agent never ordered this, refund everything.

38
00:01:57,809 --> 00:02:01,112
Northwind's Dispute desk checks the proof:

39
00:02:01,162 --> 00:02:06,620
every order signed by their agent, every payment inside their mandate

40
00:02:06,670 --> 00:02:09,255
on chain, every delivery matched.

41
00:02:09,305 --> 00:02:10,612
Twelve of twelve.

42
00:02:10,662 --> 00:02:11,650
Not refunded.

43
00:02:12,300 --> 00:02:13,773
Need something once?

44
00:02:13,823 --> 00:02:14,610
Ask Purser:

45
00:02:14,660 --> 00:02:18,874
a flight to Berlin, at most one hundred and fifty euros.

46
00:02:18,924 --> 00:02:21,539
Airwallex issues a single-use card.

47
00:02:21,589 --> 00:02:25,650
The booking goes through; a second charge is declined.

48
00:02:26,300 --> 00:02:29,530
Code decides; the models only read and advise.

49
00:02:29,580 --> 00:02:31,598
Thirty-four red-team attacks:

50
00:02:31,648 --> 00:02:32,453
all blocked.

51
00:02:32,503 --> 00:02:33,808
Eighteen scenarios:

52
00:02:33,858 --> 00:02:34,949
all as expected.

53
00:02:34,999 --> 00:02:39,441
Two people above a threshold, one Face ID to freeze everything,

54
00:02:39,491 --> 00:02:42,650
and nine cents of AI per thousand euros paid.

55
00:02:43,300 --> 00:02:44,015
Purser.

56
00:02:44,065 --> 00:02:50,136
Agents move at machine speed, and the CFO keeps the pen.

57
00:02:50,186 --> 00:02:52,650
Every euro has a proof.
